      en: ["The KIA Building was opened in 2010.", "Kuwait Investment Authority manages over 600 billion USD in assets.", "The building has 12 floors.", "It features 50,000 square meters of office space.", "Construction cost was 200 million USD.", "The building achieved LEED Gold certification for energy efficiency."],
